{"server":"tw","storyId":"act29side_level_act29side_st03","groupId":"act29side","stageId":"act29side_st03","title":"尾奏“晚霞”","storyCode":"ZT-ST-3","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act29side/level_act29side_st03.txt","sourceHash":"f6f4b96dc05153c4e3dd98afaa817e7d9a395c4424b1aeb7e8f9e99b8ed1e771","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g8_towersquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很漂亮……一如既往。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天氣已經轉涼，再過個把月，秋天就要過去了。但崔林特爾梅不怎麼下雪，晚霞依然不會缺席。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太詭異了。你實在不像是會看著風景談感想的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是想說，才半個月，這裡就已經看不出任何動亂的痕跡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雙塔依舊高聳，雲霞依舊絢爛，人們絡繹不絕地經過恩典大道與威權大道……好像什麼都沒發生過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，變化切實地發生了。我們無法忽略它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的傷怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然老爺子說問題不大，但你畢竟在荒域中逗留了太久，很難保證“侵蝕”能夠被完全消除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"起碼這半個月沒再頭痛過。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵，你比我想像的要勇敢，你救了很多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是，無法允許那些糾纏我的“餘音”再傷害到更多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你見到了“巫王”，無論有沒有唾駡他，殺死他，你都已經完成了“最後還能做的一件事”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望我沒有打擾二位的興致。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵先生，我是來找你的……代表赫琳瑪特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本以為，會是伊維格娜德來發落一個擅自返回萊塔尼亞的“死人”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫琳瑪特曾交給我兩封密信。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一封召你回到崔林特爾梅，而這一封，是她賜予你最後的選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這段時間都待在高塔裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞依然有兩位女皇，赫琳瑪特暫時不在，總得有人代為處理那些堆積如山的文書……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只能是我做，一直都是我做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你決定了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"未來的萊塔尼亞，可能只會有一座高塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"七年前，我來到崔林特爾梅覲見女皇。伊維格娜德不喜歡我的演奏、我的謹慎，或者說我所代表的魯珀坎……是赫琳瑪特救了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可不僅僅是這樣。我是她的“女皇之聲”，儘管她沒有，也不會真的敕封我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、我，甚至貴族中的某些人，許多萊塔尼亞人一直都相信著赫琳瑪特所追求的方向，不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可能是一個不再需要高塔的時代。我們還能做到很多事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說話的口氣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米夏埃爾，你比我之前見你時又成熟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，因為我……正是在長大的時候啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵先生，看來你已經讀完了信，我就先走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望你的答案，能讓自己滿意。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的表情有些微妙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫琳瑪特給了我兩個選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我將重新得到一份死亡證明。不僅僅是作為“烏提卡伯爵”，更是作為“萊塔尼亞人”……我將“死去”，得到真正的自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……或者，重回烏提卡領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我講個故事給你聽吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從前有個男孩……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不太會講故事，你將就聽。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"男孩家世代都是某位貴族的扈從。數百年裡，扈從生扈從，貴族生貴族，扈從替貴族戰鬥、流血、爭取榮譽、承受責難……\n直到某一任貴族的出現。出身、傳統、典制……他視之如敝屣，所有人在他看來都一樣。一樣的平庸、羸弱、淺薄。\n所以他一紙文書，解除了所有附庸於自己家族的扈從的身份，男孩家獲得了自由。\n後來貴族成了這個國家有史以來最有爭議的君王，他的功績與罪惡等同，他的高塔被推翻，帝國迎來了新的時代。\n他生前的許多決策被推翻，包括解除扈從的政令……\n年幼的男孩在某一天被告知，已歿君王的後裔得到了新皇帝的寬恕，重新獲得了家族的封地，他需要立刻前往高塔，覲見他的主人……\n命運似乎只是轉了個彎，又繞了回來。\n但男孩最終沒能進去那座高塔，新的變故緊跟著來了。新到任的貴族拒絕簽署召回扈從的文件，聽說那是個與自己年紀相仿的少年……\n男孩再一次得到了，“自由”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g8_towersquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"男孩名叫萊辛·梅耶爾。而黑鍵，那個新到任的貴族就是你，十二歲的烏提卡伯爵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別想了，你不會有印象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當時惴惴不安，生怕誰又在開什麼玩笑，所以拜託侍女打聽到底發生了什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她說：“小伯爵偏頭痛犯了，似乎很不開心，將所有的侍從都從房間趕了出去，好多文件都被丟在了地上。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我講這些，並不是想感嘆所謂“命運的安排”，你一個無心的舉動就改變了某個人的一生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你厭棄自己的身份，厭棄自己因此背負的那些遺憾和痛苦。你當然有理由那麼去做，你比誰都清楚它們有多麼真實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我同樣希望你清楚，它們的價值。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以及，我們到底該如何看待它們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝你能跟我講剛剛的故事，儘管你講得真的很爛……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我是不是沒說過我在“始源之角”的經歷？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來也不值一提。但我可以告訴你，巫王消失在我眼前時，我沒來得及說的話。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g15_kingsthrone"},{"type":"narration","text":"你未有子嗣，我不過是你的末裔，你我共有烏提卡這一姓氏。\n在你之前，它並未成為榮耀，也並未成為所謂的恥辱。\n它因你一人而改變。那麼我會再次改變它，但絕不以你的手段。\n這是我，嘲弄你的方式。\n這是我的恥辱，我的囚籠。\n這是我的責任，我的義務。\n這是，我的路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g8_towersquare"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你早就做好了決定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那剛剛收到女皇密信時為何是那副表情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為還有些事情，突然變得有些棘手……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"黑鍵！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終於找到你了！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是忘了自己的身份……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你可是羅德島的幹員，報到時發的幹員手冊，你不是都仔仔細細地讀過了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我邀請你們見證兩百年的罪孽如何終結……所幸永別的日子終於到來了！……我已經看清我生命的道路……”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萊辛","speakerId":"avg_4011_lessng_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她唸的是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹員離艦必須經過嚴格的審批手續，你怎麼能留下這樣一封不知所云的信，說走就走呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我還沒來得及轉交。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……芙蓉，還給我吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來很長一段時間，我都會留在萊塔尼亞。我會重新回到烏提卡領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想重新提交一份正式的離艦申請，勞煩你替我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，你最好親自去跟博士或者凱爾希醫生說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"羅德島的本艦，就在附近？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不然我為什麼會出現在這裡？倒也沒那麼近，但接下來，我們確實在萊塔尼亞周邊有些事務需要處理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"芙蓉，你似乎，對我重回烏提卡領的事情並不驚訝。離開維謝海姆後，我們的神經都繃得很緊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"芙蓉","speakerId":"avg_1024_hbisc2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你剛剛沒有說一句那種咬牙切齒但是我又聽不懂的話啊……這說明你確實已經想得很清楚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑鍵","speakerId":"avg_4046_ebnhlz_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g1_marigold"},{"type":"narration","text":"崔林特爾梅，巴赫區，巴赫街\n薇薇安娜看著眼前的院子。\n院子不大，但整理得平整。栽種著植物的角落，周圍低矮的石階也被移除，重新圍上了打過蠟的白橡木柵欄，應該是為了防止主人絆倒。\n獨棟的小房子安靜地躺在它的懷裡，剛粉刷過的潔白牆面反射著清晨的陽光，將攀上來的鉤藤的葉子染得透亮。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"進來吧，薇薇安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你沒有走錯。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這條街是巴赫當年主持“光榮首都計劃”時，特地按照自己童年居住過的街道所建……跟金盞花小巷很像，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩年前，有位養病的侯爵返回了封地，珂拉就買下了這個院子，但一直沒有過來住。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到你來了崔林特爾梅，她才讓我幫忙把這裡收拾出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看起來怎麼樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很美。就是……這些鉤藤不需要修剪得太過整齊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"讓它們隨性點長就好，不然看著會有些呆板……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……薇薇安娜，不用欲言又止。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布蘭特閣下，這是我第一次，見到您的面容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很多年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來到崔林特爾梅後，這也是我第一次摘下金律法衛的面罩，以本來面目示人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它是我的身份，我的職責，也是我的……全部。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一位“金律法衛”，不應來緬懷一位破壞女皇慶典、竄改金律樂章的主謀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布蘭特閣下，那天……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必自責，薇薇安娜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珂拉她決意要去做一件事情之後，便不會回頭。你只能那樣做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年，她因沃爾納舉薦加入新組建的皇家樂團時，眼睛就已經壞了，我答應了沃爾納，盡量幫助這個被他救下的女孩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我逐漸發現，她有自己的感受，有自己的判斷，有自己的渴望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她想幫助露辛達，想救下沃爾納，甚至想修改金律樂章……她想讓所有折磨著善良之人的遺憾，在未來都不會發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是個……堅定的女人，我向來尊敬她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可她比我想的，還要更有勇氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以珂拉她，唯有一死。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"換作是我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，無法想像那會是怎樣的場景……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……謝謝你，薇薇安娜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜，你真的想好了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來之前，我覲見了伊維格娜德，正式拒絕了女皇之聲的職務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照慣例，新遴選的女皇之聲需要在女皇慶典後進入高塔，接受兩位陛下的任命，才能正式獲得這一身份。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可赫琳瑪特陛下剛剛“失聲”，今年的女皇之聲任命儀式本來也已取消。於此時提出這個申請，還算合適。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果這是你最終的決定，我沒什麼好說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是沃爾納……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜，這已經是他能為你做的最後的、最好的安排了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要埋怨你的父親，薇薇安娜。他只是，不自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親他，對不起我和母親，可他保護了許多人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當年巫王高塔裡的珂拉，隨時會受到牽連的霍赫貝格家族，以及，被金律樂章副本推到兩難境地的施彤領的千萬人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"父親他一直在時代的漩渦裡，他曾見證、曾經歷、曾失去，他無力改變什麼，只能拼盡全力地抵擋風暴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他沒能留下什麼句子，但這依然是一個詩人書寫自我的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子，我很高興你能這麼想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，無論是送我去卡西米爾，還是安排我成為女皇之聲，都並非他覺得這條路有多麼好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是在他眼裡，我永遠都是那個需要保護而他沒能保護好的孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我不會怪他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那想必，你也不會回到施彤領。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身在卡西米爾時，我覺得自己只是個“異鄉人”。那些璀璨的霓虹、喧囂的競技場，那些被計算的戰鬥與榮譽……它們不屬於我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可我回到了施彤領，回到了崔林特爾梅，這種感覺同樣存在。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞之於我而言，只有那些暗夜裡的燭火和書本，還有隨處盛開的金盞花。而金盞花的花語，本就是，“離別”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從來都，有能力做選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人們總是在有得選的時候，才能真正面對自己的軟弱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布蘭特閣下……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女皇慶典之後，你說在荒域中的某些見聞，有必要讓你在卡西米爾的朋友知曉……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我已經寄出了信。想必應該快有回音了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼接下來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“向燈塔去。也向燈塔消失的地方去。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是小時候讀過的一本書裡的句子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請允許我向您告別。再見，布蘭特閣下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布蘭特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g1_marigold"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜小姐！呼——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_498_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜小姐，您等了半個月的那位“臨光”已經到了，就在前面的路口。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g1_gorgeousstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_4064_mlynar_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薇薇安娜·德羅斯特女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薇薇安娜","speakerId":"avg_4098_vvana_1","isRemote":false,"text":"瑪恩納先生……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_4064_mlynar_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您寄來的信函，臨光家已收悉。我正好在萊塔尼亞邊境，已經用最快的速度趕來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_4064_mlynar_1","isRemote":false,"text":"信中說，您見到了甚至觸摸過印有臨光家徽記的征戰騎士的劍槍……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"瑪恩納","speakerId":"avg_4064_mlynar_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要知道，全部。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g5_noblehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這就是，屬於此刻的旋律？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您聽見的，就是我感知到的全部情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……和我平時聽到的，並沒有區別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"崔林特爾梅的人們愛著您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而您也愛著他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這一點，從未發生過改變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我從“始源之角”回到現實的時候，你也在現場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為我演奏當時的旋律吧，薩科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我並不能做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記錄不了一滴淚劃過臉頰的瞬間。倘若它並未在心靈深處開花結果，那它就只是一滴留不住的水，在落下的那刻就被日光蒸發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這座塔剛剛建起的那一年，有一位學者在萊塔尼亞法術學院公開授課。他聲稱誕生於術式的人，天生就沒有靈魂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第二天，他收到了……一紙調令。他獲得了原本一輩子都不可能發生的拔擢，成了女皇的近侍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜短短一年之後，他就因為過勞而死在了高塔深處。死前他留下了一本學術巨著，逐條推翻了他先前所有的觀點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想看看這本書嗎，薩科塔？它寫得很平庸，我沒有允許它的出版。但它包含的情感……倒是還挺有趣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是準備……把我也關在您的高塔裡嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩科塔，誰讓你到這裡來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"女皇的術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_491_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女皇並未准允你來覲見！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"讓他過來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭公證所執行者費德里科，已於日前透過女皇之聲遞交過多次見面申請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你就是那個……拉特蘭的聖徒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我來這裡，是為了帶走通緝犯阿爾圖羅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的姐姐在萊塔尼亞幹了很多事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"前皇家樂團調音師珂拉·洛文斯坦及巫王殘黨……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……珂拉？ 不，我說的不是那些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"路德維格大學事件早就結案，女皇慶典雖有變故，但最後的演奏效果令人滿意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也見證了所有的過程，聖徒先生。我希望在你離開萊塔尼亞之後，萊塔尼亞的強大與壯美，依然能給你留下深刻的印象。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從您的表述來看，關於阿爾圖羅及她所犯案件，萊塔尼亞準備拒絕與拉特蘭進行任何形式上的溝通？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你在質疑……我的決定？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"費德里科聽到了劍鋒與地面碰撞的聲響。\n他抬起頭，看向萊塔尼亞的女皇。\n伊維格娜德站在晚霞能照到的地方，裙擺灑滿暖金，然而她身後有一條陰影構成的長廊。\n數十名金律法衛站在那裡，沉默著。他們的劍在鳴響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科·吉亞洛，先別動。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？一個法術裝置……拉特蘭人製造的無人機？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“造型獨特的無人機”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1136_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是一個小機器。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“造型獨特的無人機”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1136_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在某些場合，您也可以把我視作“信使”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"誰的信使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“造型獨特的無人機”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1136_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我屬於……拉特蘭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"“造型獨特的無人機”","speakerId":"avg_npc_1136_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞的女皇，有人想見您。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_356_1","isRemote":true,"text":"好久不見了，伊維格娜德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……教宗閣下。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g6_towerterrace"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"陛下，阿爾圖羅·吉亞洛已被帶走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我看見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您要留下她的話，就算伊萬杰利斯塔十一世本人親自過來，我們也不會讓他們輕易離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我對此毫不懷疑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，那位衰老的教宗帶來了一個訊息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他說……“災難”就快到了。屆時受影響的必不會只有拉特蘭。他希望萊塔尼亞能與拉特蘭攜手共進，共禦危機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭的一貫說辭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫爾昏佐倫也說了類似的話。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就在那片混沌中，在他為自己打造的虛幻王座面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他說“希望已經逝去，永恆已經消亡”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在那之後，我也親眼看見了……混沌中蟄伏的敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在某個時刻，它們無限接近我們的萊塔尼亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……只要您下令，我們會為您追回那個薩科塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不止那名薩科塔。我們會做任何事，不惜……一切代價，找到重新進入那片混沌空間的方法，迎回赫琳瑪特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希爾德加德啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在“始源之角”崩塌的最後一刻，我撐起了盾，護住了雙塔和雙塔下的萬民……除了她。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"布蘭特，再陪我看一會這片晚霞吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我問她，想不想問我為什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"問我為什麼明知道一切會發生，還要放任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"問我為什麼……會在最後一刻背過身去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她沒有問。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她甚至沒有一絲猶豫，只是做了平常會做的事，轉過身去，迎擊敵人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"擦肩而過時，她對我說的最後一句話，是祝我……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……能如願擁有這片晚霞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫琳瑪特……是一名偉大的君主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們將銘記她的付出，繼續為萊塔尼亞的未來而戰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這麼說，你也做出了選擇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金律法衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_1117_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……是，陛下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很好，布蘭特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫爾昏佐倫在不可能的混沌中建起了一座塔，給了它與現實中已倒下的那座相同的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他宣布那是永恆的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那麼，我也能做到。不，我比赫爾昏佐倫更完美，當然也能做到更多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要令我們所見的這片晚霞恆久不變。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊維格娜德","speakerId":"avg_npc_487_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萊塔尼亞，以及未來屬於萊塔尼亞的一切，都將沐浴於……“永恆恩典”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"44_g3_ludwigsuniv_outside"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就這些東西了，您再怎麼看，也不可能把這幾座塔裝進口袋帶走啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……真的不能嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦好啦，別這樣委屈地瞪著我了，大不了我把那個咒術化形課門口的大雕像放回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您把那東西裝進了我的小方塊？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？那可是我一百年前灑過巨獸血的好東西欸！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走。馬上走。你不走我們也要走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃芒加德，我們是不是真的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫妖沒法把自己變成萊塔尼亞人。您在這裡待得最久，難道不是最清楚的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲流浪於這片大地，而巫妖……向來是薩卡茲中的流浪者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們行走於大地，收集知識，守衛知識。我們不能讓戰火與紛爭毀去我們的傳承，因此只要任何地方不再安定，我們就會立即離開。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而萊塔尼亞即將迎來劇變。赫琳瑪特留在了混沌之中，再也沒有人能遏止伊維格娜德。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵……赫爾昏佐倫，你這活該再死一千遍的老傢伙，看看你給我們留下的爛攤子，有沒有想再重活一次的衝動？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有也沒關係，沒可能了。就算有那個機會，也得留給更有朝氣點的年輕人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是說赫琳瑪特還有機會……您想好怎麼再次進入荒域了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別急，沒那麼快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過赫爾昏佐倫說得對，“湮滅”的時刻快到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等災難降臨於整片大地，哪裡還能是巫妖的安定之所？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以說啊，我們也別浪費力氣了。小傢伙，巫妖的流浪時代該結束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您說吧，去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還能去哪？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弗萊蒙特","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴你在卡茲戴爾新交的好朋友，巫妖王庭……不，沒有什麼王庭，告訴他們，知識聖殿的看守人，準備回家了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"與伊維格娜德的特殊通訊結束了。我分享了拉特蘭的警示，再一次提出希望與萊塔尼亞攜手並進。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"屆時，我們會根據費德里科·吉亞洛帶回的訊息，對發生在崔林特爾梅的異變作進一步分析。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顯然，那絕不僅是一場巫王殘餘勢力的作亂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許，那是“災難”在萊塔尼亞的預兆，與拉特蘭正面臨的警示相似。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"伊維格娜德，如今萊塔尼亞唯一能夠發聲的女皇……她的措辭足夠得體，態度足夠模糊。我甚至能想像到她的表情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……預期之中。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萬國峰會之後，“拉特蘭主張”並未得到太多實際的回應。從最遠的海岸線到核心圈，“災異”仍被許多國家視作秘密。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭因信仰而團結，隔閡始終是這片大地永恆的病症。可如若等到那“災難”在未來將所有國家連綴成一體……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……為時已晚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們已隱約觸摸到“災難”的輪廓，卻依舊無法推演其來源？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭將加速推進緊急應對機制建設。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊萬杰利斯塔十一世","speakerId":"avg_npc_1114_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我需要再次確認適合人員名單。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g1_gorgeousstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"手續上的交接就到這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"按照拉特蘭與萊塔尼亞的雙邊協議，當有需要的時候，我與女皇之聲將確保阿爾圖羅·吉亞洛會回到萊塔尼亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上述協議已確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……那就這樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來大概是真的再見了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"米夏埃爾，無論我在拉特蘭還是在羅德島，你都可以來找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"米夏埃爾","speakerId":"avg_4109_baslin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？我不太習慣，執行者閣下，你怎麼突然說出了這麼有人情味的話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人情味？過於模糊的形容詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是，有一種……直覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"事件仍未完全結束。更確切地說，我們所經歷的，僅僅只是一個開端。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"28_g1_gorgeousstreets"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"費德里科，你終於來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"女皇已經放行，不等於我可以直接將你帶走。移交手續比計劃中更繁瑣一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦你了，費德里科。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在混沌之中，你聽到了赫爾昏佐倫的遺言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他究竟告訴了你什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"許多人都想知道答案。貴族，學者，巫王殘黨，伊維格娜德……每個人都在猜測赫爾昏佐倫的遺產究竟是什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"權柄，力量，還是知識？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得呢，費德里科？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我只看到了一大堆不存在於現實的幻影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"巫王赫爾昏佐倫死在了二十三年前，這是唯一的事實。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論在那片混沌的空間裡，他為自己虛構了多少影像，說了多少話語，都不過是一段段往日的回音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赫爾昏佐倫從未征服過死亡，但他將自己一生的情感鐫刻於虛空之上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他的得意，失意，憤恨，遺憾……還有期望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他說，我們的始源也是終點，我們的能力即是桎梏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難以解讀的危機。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或許這也與教宗閣下的態度存在某種關聯。將你帶回拉特蘭，這是他交付給我的任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿爾圖羅，在塔前劇場，你說你並未主動選擇離開拉特蘭……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……嗯哼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我承認條律有其空白，情感或許可以作為補足的力量，幫助拉特蘭應對危機。但這無從界定，必然伴隨著未知的風險。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，我會對你保持更高的警惕，審慎判斷你行為的主觀動機與可能導致的客觀結果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果發現任何可疑的地方，我會擊斃你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聖徒閣下，最為理性的你，屆時也最適合作為我的行刑人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好了，費德里科。不著急啟程的話，就好好看看這片雲霞吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是崔林特爾梅最美的時刻。這樣的美麗……短暫，且脆弱。很快，就要入夜了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還記得你曾問我的那個問題嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭城似乎永遠潔白無瑕，永遠光輝璀璨。那麼當它入夜時，第一個亮燈的地方是哪裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我當時答應過你，要帶你去拉特蘭最高的地方看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"受封聖徒的那天，在覲見教宗之後，我去了大教堂頂上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭城入夜後，啟示石塔右側的街道會首先亮燈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也專門去調查過原因。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭電力管理所對全城公共用電系統進行了統一規劃，最先亮燈的區域是啟示石塔所在的街區。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"管理所的操作員阿爾奇德是個有輕度強迫症的左撇子，每天都習慣性先按控制面板最左邊的開關。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以啟示石塔右側的街道為起點，經米迦萊昂區的公證所與大大小小的銃械工坊，聖瑪律索區的夕輝禮拜堂，一路向教堂廣場。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"入夜後的拉特蘭，街燈有序亮起……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不出所料，最為理性的你，得出的答案也……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"費德里科","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……依然好看。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我本來想說，在那個小房間，我其實並沒有你所見的那麼驚慌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恆常的黑暗，恆常的沉默，並不會阻絕兩個人之間的感受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然，你的發現並不賴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它提醒了我，這本身是一個肯定能找到答案的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"街燈會再次亮起，甚至我們頭頂這小小的光環也不曾寂滅……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光亮恆常，黑暗才是暫時的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我們的情感呢……悲哀與喜悅都只存在於生命的某一刻，但我們無時無刻不在感受著一切的發生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以它們從來不曾真正消失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿爾圖羅","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……就像晚霞，從未離開這片天空。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
